-- ============================================================
-- 05_ratings.sql
-- Ratings for the Kevin Bacon 6-Degrees Demo Database
--
-- Redesigned 2026-08-02: one row per movie, a single synthetic
-- platform_score (0-10), in the style of a streaming platform's
-- own rating display (e.g. a Netflix-style score), rather than a
-- breakdown across IMDb/Rotten Tomatoes/Metacritic. This avoids
-- any appearance of reproducing or claiming to represent a real
-- third-party platform's actual score.
--
-- platform_score is loosely informed by each film's real-world
-- critical/audience reception (well-regarded classics score high,
-- widely-panned films score low, average films land in the
-- middle), but is a SYNTHETIC, LLM-reconstructed value, not
-- sourced from or claiming to represent any actual platform's
-- real rating.
--
-- rating_count is a simulated popularity count (more prominent
-- films get larger counts, obscure films get smaller counts) for
-- narrative realism only; it does not reflect any real platform's
-- actual rating volume.
-- ============================================================

